      "content": "i know what i did, but it doesnt change the fact that i'm just empty. i've spent years being the \"strong one\" and now that hes gone there's nothing left. i feel like i've wasted my life just waiting for things to get better, but nothing does. its just a cycle of pain. what's the point in even trying to get better if it just leads back to this?",
